{"id":"4b4442b7440f4f5a","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-order9-booleanization.md","title":"ZFC Order9 Booleanization","display":"df-zfc-order9-booleanization — ZFC Order9 Booleanization","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order9-booleanization","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order9-booleanization"],"display":"df-zfc-order9-booleanization — ZFC Order9 Booleanization","depends_on":["[[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order9-booleanization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order9-booleanization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order9-booleanization — ZFC Order9 Booleanization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a5e10857074b912e\" href=\"?note=a5e10857074b912e\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra\">../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,L,\\wedge,\\vee,0,1\\in V\">\\(B,L,\\wedge,\\vee,0,1\\in V\\)</span> (Boolean center and bounded-lattice data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Boolean}\">\\(\\mathrm{Boolean}\\)</span> (Boolean-algebra predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9Booleanization}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9Booleanization}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}booleanization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9Booleanization}_S(B,L,\\wedge,\\vee,0,1)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;L\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\wedge,\\vee\\in L^{L\\times L}\\land0,1\\in L\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in L\\;\\Bigl((a\\wedge b)\\wedge c=a\\wedge(b\\wedge c)\\land(a\\vee b)\\vee c=a\\vee(b\\vee c)\n\\land a\\wedge b=b\\wedge a\\land a\\vee b=b\\vee a\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land a\\wedge(a\\vee b)=a\\land a\\vee(a\\wedge b)=a\n\\land a\\wedge(b\\vee c)=(a\\wedge b)\\vee(a\\wedge c)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land a\\vee(b\\wedge c)=(a\\vee b)\\wedge(a\\vee c)\n\\land a\\wedge1=a\\land a\\vee0=a\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land B=\\{a\\in L\\mid\\exists b\\in L\\;(a\\wedge b=0\\land a\\vee b=1)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\neg_B\\in B^B\\;\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge\\upharpoonright(B\\times B),\\vee\\upharpoonright(B\\times B),\\neg_B,0,1).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}booleanization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9Booleanization}_S(B,L,\\wedge,\\vee,0,1)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&amp;L\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\wedge,\\vee\\in L^{L\\times L}\\land0,1\\in L\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in L\\;\\Bigl((a\\wedge b)\\wedge c=a\\wedge(b\\wedge c)\\land(a\\vee b)\\vee c=a\\vee(b\\vee c)\n\\land a\\wedge b=b\\wedge a\\land a\\vee b=b\\vee a\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land a\\wedge(a\\vee b)=a\\land a\\vee(a\\wedge b)=a\n\\land a\\wedge(b\\vee c)=(a\\wedge b)\\vee(a\\wedge c)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land a\\vee(b\\wedge c)=(a\\vee b)\\wedge(a\\vee c)\n\\land a\\wedge1=a\\land a\\vee0=a\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land B=\\{a\\in L\\mid\\exists b\\in L\\;(a\\wedge b=0\\land a\\vee b=1)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists\\neg_B\\in B^B\\;\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge\\upharpoonright(B\\times B),\\vee\\upharpoonright(B\\times B),\\neg_B,0,1).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The bounded distributive-lattice laws are explicit, and the Boolean center carries a bound complement operation rather than an undeclared five-place Boolean-algebra predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a5e10857074b912e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-boolean-algebra]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B,L,\\wedge,\\vee,0,1\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Boolean}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9Booleanization}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order9\\text{-}booleanization}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder9Booleanization}_S(B,L,\\wedge,\\vee,0,1)\\leftrightarrow{}\\\\\n&L\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\wedge,\\vee\\in L^{L\\times L}\\land0,1\\in L\\\\\n&\\land\\forall a,b,c\\in L\\;\\Bigl((a\\wedge b)\\wedge c=a\\wedge(b\\wedge c)\\land(a\\vee b)\\vee c=a\\vee(b\\vee c)\n\\land a\\wedge b=b\\wedge a\\land a\\vee b=b\\vee a\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land a\\wedge(a\\vee b)=a\\land a\\vee(a\\wedge b)=a\n\\land a\\wedge(b\\vee c)=(a\\wedge b)\\vee(a\\wedge c)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land a\\vee(b\\wedge c)=(a\\vee b)\\wedge(a\\vee c)\n\\land a\\wedge1=a\\land a\\vee0=a\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land B=\\{a\\in L\\mid\\exists b\\in L\\;(a\\wedge b=0\\land a\\vee b=1)\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\exists\\neg_B\\in B^B\\;\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge\\upharpoonright(B\\times B),\\vee\\upharpoonright(B\\times B),\\neg_B,0,1).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1537,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2963","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-order9-booleanization.md|58-df-zfc-order9-booleanization]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a5e10857074b912e"]}